# Tastatur

> Cookieless, privacy-first web analytics. One script tag, 3.2 KB over the wire. No cookies, no device storage, no fingerprinting, and visitor identifiers stop working after 24 hours.

The marketing page and the documentation are also served as markdown: fetch the `.md` URLs below directly, or request the HTML paths with `Accept: text/markdown`.

## Docs

- [What Tastatur is](<%= markdown_root_url %>): the marketing page — what it measures, how an anonymous visit is counted, and what it will not claim
- [Documentation](<%= docs_url(format: :md) %>): install, script options, custom events, revenue, single-page apps, goals, funnels, Content Security Policy, the server-side HTTP API, opt-out, and what gets collected

## Policies

- [What it collects](<%= privacy_url %>): the full technical account of what is measured about a site's visitors (HTML)
- [Privacy policy](<%= privacy_policy_url %>): how this instance handles its account holders' data (HTML)
- [Terms of service](<%= terms_url %>) (HTML)
- [Data processing agreement](<%= dpa_url %>) (HTML)
- [Your data](<%= data_request_url %>): shows a visitor what this instance holds about them, derived from their live connection (HTML)

## Optional

- [About](<%= about_url %>): who builds Tastatur and why (HTML)
<% if Tastatur.billing_enabled? -%>
- [Pricing](<%= pricing_url %>): plans on the hosted service (HTML)
<% end -%>
